  <string name="help_center_content">Welcome to Loomea Help Center!

Booking an Appointment
Browse salons from the home page or search by name, service, or category. Select the services you want, pick a time slot, and confirm your booking.

Managing Appointments
View your upcoming and past appointments in the My Appointments tab. You can reschedule or cancel upcoming appointments from there.

Favorite Salons
Tap the heart icon on any salon to save it to your favorites for quick access later.

Payment Methods
Add and manage your payment methods from Profile &gt; Payment Methods.

Need more help?
Contact us at support@loomea.app</string>
  <string name="terms_of_service_content">Last updated: March 2026

1. Acceptance of Terms
By accessing and using the Loomea application, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.

2. Use of Service
Loomea provides a platform connecting users with beauty and wellness salons. You agree to use the service only for lawful purposes.

3. Bookings &amp; Cancellations
Appointments can be cancelled up to 24 hours before the scheduled time. Late cancellations may be subject to a fee.

4. User Accounts
You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials.

5. Limitation of Liability
Loomea acts as an intermediary and is not liable for the quality of services provided by salons.

6. Changes to Terms
We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use constitutes acceptance.</string>
  <string name="privacy_policy_content">Last updated: March 2026

1. Information We Collect
We collect information you provide directly, such as your name, email, phone number, and payment details.

2. How We Use Your Information
Your information is used to provide and improve our services, process bookings, send notifications, and personalize your experience.

3. Data Sharing
We share your booking details with the salons you book with. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.

4. Data Security
We implement appropriate security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access.

5. Your Rights
You can access, update, or delete your personal information at any time through the app settings.

6. Contact
For privacy-related inquiries, contact us at privacy@loomea.app</string>

